WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:03.008
Division means sharing equally.

00:03.458 --> 00:09.727
We have twelve counters and three friends. We want everyone to get the same amount.

00:10.177 --> 00:15.332
Hand them out one at a time, round and round, until none are left.

00:15.782 --> 00:20.728
Each friend gets four. So twelve divided by three is four.

00:21.178 --> 00:29.746
We can check with multiplication. Three groups of four make twelve. Division and multiplication are partners.
